WEBVTT

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:15.140
<i>It's a new year. January 2.</i>

00:00:25.316 --> 00:00:27.736
You're sleeping the day away!

00:00:27.819 --> 00:00:29.070
It's already noon.

00:00:29.154 --> 00:00:30.280
Shut up.

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:35.577
Huh? Hang on. Why are you here?

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:36.953
Huh?

00:00:46.713 --> 00:00:51.009
<i>When a person has extreme social anxiety,</i>

00:00:51.092 --> 00:00:53.595
<i>they struggle to communicate with others.</i>

00:00:56.598 --> 00:00:58.600
<i>Bear in mind,</i>

00:00:59.601 --> 00:01:01.144
<i>they only struggle to form connections.</i>

00:01:01.853 --> 00:01:04.898
<i>It doesn't mean they don't want to.</i>

00:02:41.327 --> 00:02:42.203
C'mon now.

00:02:42.287 --> 00:02:44.789
Did you forget why I'm here?

00:02:44.873 --> 00:02:47.625
We were up late last night playing games.

00:02:47.709 --> 00:02:50.086
Oh, were we?

00:02:50.170 --> 00:02:51.713
Yes, we were, Tadano!

00:02:52.714 --> 00:02:57.385
New Year's means going to the shrine!
Yes, let's go to the shrine!

00:02:57.468 --> 00:02:59.762
I'm eating lunch now, so wait.

00:02:59.846 --> 00:03:01.973
-Stare…
-Don't watch me.

00:03:03.433 --> 00:03:07.186
So we'll invite everyone
and we'll all swarm the shrine!

00:03:07.270 --> 00:03:08.646
There's street stalls too!

00:03:08.730 --> 00:03:10.648
They've probably already gone.

00:03:10.732 --> 00:03:13.484
It doesn't matter
how many times we go. It's fun!

00:03:13.568 --> 00:03:15.778
-Hello, Komi?
-That was fast.

00:03:15.862 --> 00:03:17.113
Do you have time now?

00:03:17.196 --> 00:03:20.992
Yes, yes, everyone's going to the shrine.

00:03:21.075 --> 00:03:22.493
Yeah! Ha-ha!

00:03:22.577 --> 00:03:25.079
Okay. See you at six! Bye!

00:03:25.163 --> 00:03:26.372
Couldn't get through.

00:03:26.456 --> 00:03:28.541
Huh? What was that performance for?

00:03:28.625 --> 00:03:30.501
YAMAI'S NEW YEAR'S

00:03:30.585 --> 00:03:33.463
NAJIMI

00:03:34.756 --> 00:03:36.591
Hello?

00:03:37.091 --> 00:03:39.510
<i>Hi, Yamai. Let's go to the shrine!</i>

00:03:39.594 --> 00:03:42.472
Ah-ha, Najimi. Sorry.

00:03:42.555 --> 00:03:44.849
I'm in Hawaii right now.

00:03:44.933 --> 00:03:46.517
Truly sorry.

00:03:46.601 --> 00:03:48.061
She's so obnoxious!

00:03:48.144 --> 00:03:49.729
Oh yeah? Too bad!

00:03:49.812 --> 00:03:51.522
-Since Komi's coming.
-A LIE.

00:03:52.982 --> 00:03:55.026
Now, who should I call next?

00:03:55.109 --> 00:03:57.946
I think you did the right thing.

00:03:58.029 --> 00:03:59.906
NAKANAKA'S NEW YEAR'S

00:03:59.989 --> 00:04:02.367
<i>Today's the PGO game New Year's event!</i>

00:04:02.450 --> 00:04:04.369
<i>A time-limited boss battle!</i>

00:04:04.452 --> 00:04:07.413
<i>The difficulty level</i>
<i>is perfect! Thrilling!</i>

00:04:07.497 --> 00:04:09.749
<i>Here we go! Only 30 seconds left!</i>

00:04:09.832 --> 00:04:11.334
<i>It'll be a close call!</i>

00:04:11.417 --> 00:04:13.920
<i>I'm in the zone!</i>

00:04:14.003 --> 00:04:14.837
NAJIMI

00:04:15.505 --> 00:04:17.257
Nakanaka said she will come.

00:04:17.757 --> 00:04:18.841
R-Really?

00:04:18.925 --> 00:04:21.803
-AGARI'S NEW YEAR'S
-How many mochi is that?

00:04:21.886 --> 00:04:23.304
Hm?

00:04:23.388 --> 00:04:24.639
NAJIMI

00:04:24.722 --> 00:04:28.101
AGARI IS CHOKING ON MOCHI.

00:04:29.727 --> 00:04:30.561
Agari?

00:04:30.645 --> 00:04:32.981
YADANO'S NEW YEAR'S

00:04:33.606 --> 00:04:34.774
BROTHER, KATSUKI

00:04:35.400 --> 00:04:36.734
<i>You're not bad at this!</i>

00:04:36.818 --> 00:04:40.738
<i>I've trained all year with Komi</i>
<i>and you're able to keep up!</i>

00:04:42.031 --> 00:04:45.201
<i>Makeru, battledore snipe sho--</i>

00:04:45.285 --> 00:04:46.327
RING

00:04:46.411 --> 00:04:47.787
<i>Broke my concentration!</i>

00:04:47.870 --> 00:04:50.873
Hello? This is Makeru Yadano's brother.

00:04:50.957 --> 00:04:52.875
She's busy being a sore loser.

00:04:52.959 --> 00:04:55.253
Oh, I think she can go to the shrine.

00:04:55.336 --> 00:04:57.755
<i>Everyone's timing is so bad!</i>

00:04:57.839 --> 00:05:00.508
Not fair making me do all the work!

00:05:00.591 --> 00:05:02.510
Tadano, you call someone!

00:05:02.593 --> 00:05:04.762
You're the one who wanted to go.

00:05:04.846 --> 00:05:05.972
I'll do it though.

00:05:08.558 --> 00:05:11.269
-Hi! This is Kazuya Onemine, age five!
-ONEMINE'S NEW YEAR'S

00:05:11.352 --> 00:05:12.270
<i>Who?!</i>

00:05:12.353 --> 00:05:13.396
<i>Little twerp!</i>

00:05:13.479 --> 00:05:16.524
<i>Don't answer my phone! I already told you!</i>

00:05:16.607 --> 00:05:18.526
<i>Ow!</i>

00:05:19.569 --> 00:05:20.445
Tadano?

00:05:20.528 --> 00:05:24.115
Uh, um. Do you want to go
with us to the shrine today?

00:05:24.198 --> 00:05:26.492
The shrine? Yeah!

00:05:26.576 --> 00:05:27.869
Shut up!

00:05:35.585 --> 00:05:37.337
Spade!

00:05:37.420 --> 00:05:38.629
So long…

00:05:41.340 --> 00:05:45.136
Hello? This is Otori.

00:05:45.219 --> 00:05:46.471
Oh, Otori?

00:05:46.554 --> 00:05:50.266
We're all planning on going
to the shrine today.

00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:53.895
Ah, that sounds nice.

00:05:56.022 --> 00:05:59.901
Huh? Is it already the new year?

00:05:59.984 --> 00:06:01.694
Hm? Yes.

00:06:01.778 --> 00:06:04.655
Oh, I see.

00:06:05.281 --> 00:06:11.746
I've been watching the
fireplace video since Christmas.

00:06:11.829 --> 00:06:14.665
-<i>Huh? Chris… huh?</i>
-OTORI'S NEW YEAR'S

00:06:15.583 --> 00:06:18.211
Najimi, do you mind if I invite Katai?

00:06:18.294 --> 00:06:19.712
I can't leave him out.

00:06:19.796 --> 00:06:21.631
-I'll allow it.
-Hm.

00:06:21.714 --> 00:06:22.715
KATAI'S NEW YEAR'S

00:06:22.799 --> 00:06:25.051
-Oi! Twenty more!
-SISTER, AI

00:06:25.134 --> 00:06:28.429
Yeah! Put your heart into those push-ups!

00:06:30.973 --> 00:06:32.892
<i>Ngh… the phone.</i>

00:06:32.975 --> 00:06:35.853
-<i>Tadano? I have to answer!</i>
-TADANO

00:06:35.937 --> 00:06:38.648
<i>He…llo… Ungh.</i>

00:06:38.731 --> 00:06:40.775
<i>Oh. Ta… Tadano.</i>

00:06:40.858 --> 00:06:44.153
<i>W-What are you doing? Katai?</i>

00:06:44.654 --> 00:06:46.531
<i>Inaka's New Year's.</i>

00:06:46.614 --> 00:06:48.741
<i>In the country, with no signal.</i>

00:06:48.825 --> 00:06:49.867
Yup!

00:06:49.951 --> 00:06:52.703
You've got it in you! Go! Go!

00:06:52.787 --> 00:06:54.747
<i>W-Who's that girl?</i>

00:06:54.831 --> 00:06:58.709
<i>She's keeping pace with the runners!</i>
<i>For over fifteen minutes!</i>

00:06:59.877 --> 00:07:02.296
<i>The popular,</i>
<i>life-loving group's New Year's.</i>

00:07:02.380 --> 00:07:05.091
They're just at Wac, eating or whatever.

00:07:05.174 --> 00:07:06.300
They'll come.

00:07:06.384 --> 00:07:10.304
Is that really loving life?

00:07:10.388 --> 00:07:12.140
I'm bored.

00:07:12.223 --> 00:07:15.309
Alright! We've called nearly everyone!

00:07:15.393 --> 00:07:18.479
-I could call 4,000 more people.
-No!

00:07:25.695 --> 00:07:29.157
M-Maybe we should
try calling Komi one more time.

00:07:29.240 --> 00:07:30.408
GRIN

00:07:30.491 --> 00:07:32.410
T-That's not what I mean!

00:07:32.493 --> 00:07:35.538
-Everyone will be expecting her!
-THOUSAND-ARMED TADANO

00:07:35.621 --> 00:07:38.541
And anyway, if Yamai comes
all the way from Hawaii,

00:07:38.624 --> 00:07:40.126
she'll find out you lied.

00:07:40.209 --> 00:07:42.128
I'm not saying you shouldn't.

00:07:58.436 --> 00:07:59.937
Hurry and call!

00:08:00.021 --> 00:08:01.439
-KOMI
-A call!

00:08:01.522 --> 00:08:02.857
It's from Komi!

00:08:02.940 --> 00:08:05.735
Hello hello! Sorry you had to call back.

00:08:05.818 --> 00:08:07.987
Oh, you were in a tunnel! I see.

00:08:08.070 --> 00:08:11.240
-Are you embarrassed?
-We're going to the shrine.

00:08:11.824 --> 00:08:13.576
Yeah. See ya!

00:08:16.704 --> 00:08:18.414
<i>I-Insufferable.</i>

00:08:19.123 --> 00:08:20.917
Everyone's here!

00:08:21.501 --> 00:08:24.504
Now then… we're off!

00:08:24.587 --> 00:08:27.131
To the shrine!

00:08:27.215 --> 00:08:29.258
It's not that kind of event.

00:08:31.511 --> 00:08:34.180
Oh. Happy New Year.

00:08:36.307 --> 00:08:37.892
HAPPY NEW YEAR.

00:08:37.975 --> 00:08:38.809
Yeah.

00:08:40.269 --> 00:08:41.979
Shall we head up?

00:08:44.732 --> 00:08:50.738
RESTLESS

00:08:52.865 --> 00:08:54.700
Do you want to run too?

00:09:00.998 --> 00:09:03.376
<i>Off to the shrine.</i>

00:09:05.545 --> 00:09:07.964
Tadano, let's get fortunes!

00:09:08.047 --> 00:09:10.216
After we've paid our respects.

00:09:10.299 --> 00:09:12.176
-Let's go big luck!
-SMALL LUCK

00:09:12.260 --> 00:09:13.678
<i>Small luck.</i>

00:09:13.761 --> 00:09:15.513
How is everyone else's?

00:09:15.596 --> 00:09:18.057
This is my first fortune ever!

00:09:18.140 --> 00:09:19.684
Komi, how is yours?

00:09:28.234 --> 00:09:29.735
Why are you hiding it?

00:09:30.903 --> 00:09:33.489
Komi? Um. Show me.

00:09:33.573 --> 00:09:34.615
What?

00:09:34.699 --> 00:09:38.619
KOMI'S FORTUNE
BIG LUCK

00:09:38.703 --> 00:09:40.580
It's perfect.

00:09:40.663 --> 00:09:42.331
DATE PLAN TO GET CLOSER TO TADANO

00:09:42.415 --> 00:09:44.834
-<i>It's perfect.</i>
-Your grinning is gross.

00:09:44.917 --> 00:09:46.711
It's perfect!

00:09:46.794 --> 00:09:48.421
EARLY TO BED, EARLY TO RISE

00:09:49.005 --> 00:09:51.632
<i>Alright, I'm going to invite Tadano!</i>

00:09:51.716 --> 00:09:53.384
The way you're sitting is gross.

00:09:54.135 --> 00:09:56.804
<i>When we went to the shrine the other day,</i>

00:09:56.887 --> 00:10:00.057
<i>I didn't really get to talk to Tadano.</i>

00:10:00.141 --> 00:10:03.603
<i>That's the only time</i>
<i>I've gone out all break.</i>

00:10:03.686 --> 00:10:05.187
<i>It's not healthy.</i>

00:10:05.688 --> 00:10:07.648
<i>I do like staying home, but…</i>

00:10:08.149 --> 00:10:10.651
<i>Alright, I'm going to invite Tadano out!</i>

00:10:11.152 --> 00:10:11.986
TADANO

00:10:12.069 --> 00:10:13.904
I-I did it!

00:10:14.989 --> 00:10:15.990
Hello?

00:10:16.073 --> 00:10:18.034
He answered!

00:10:18.117 --> 00:10:20.453
Uh, I have to say my name.

00:10:20.536 --> 00:10:24.457
Oh, but it's so embarrassing
to say my own name.

00:10:24.540 --> 00:10:27.835
But I have to say something.
What else can I say?

00:10:28.336 --> 00:10:30.338
-It's me.
-<i>The "it's me" phone scam?</i>

00:10:30.421 --> 00:10:34.050
Um, Katai? What's up?

00:10:34.133 --> 00:10:35.926
I have to say why I called!

00:10:36.010 --> 00:10:39.347
First, I should ask
if he has time to talk.

00:10:39.430 --> 00:10:42.308
-Hey Tadano. You have time to talk?
-IDEAL

00:10:43.559 --> 00:10:45.686
-<i>I'm so nervous!</i>
-REALITY

00:10:45.770 --> 00:10:49.857
<i>Uh… Can I…</i>

00:10:49.940 --> 00:10:51.442
<i>do it?</i>

00:10:51.525 --> 00:10:53.152
D-do what?

00:10:53.235 --> 00:10:56.906
-<i>Uh, you know… Let's uh…</i>
-KATAI'S ASKING IF IT'S ALRIGHT TO CALL.

00:10:56.989 --> 00:10:58.866
-<i>Do it together?</i>
-KATAI'S INVITING HIM SKATING.

00:10:58.949 --> 00:11:00.409
K-Katai?!

00:11:00.493 --> 00:11:03.120
KATAI EXPLAINS EVERYTHING

00:11:03.204 --> 00:11:06.624
Oh, I see. Ice skating! Sure!

00:11:06.707 --> 00:11:09.210
<i>Tadano!</i>

00:11:09.293 --> 00:11:13.047
Can I invite some other people?
If you don't mind.

00:11:13.130 --> 00:11:15.591
Oh. Of course.

00:11:15.675 --> 00:11:17.927
I did want it to be just us two!

00:11:18.010 --> 00:11:22.056
But this'll be a good opportunity
to make more male friends.

00:11:22.139 --> 00:11:24.683
Alright! I can do it!

00:11:29.939 --> 00:11:30.940
Morning, Katai!

00:11:35.152 --> 00:11:37.113
<i>Mentor!</i>

00:11:37.196 --> 00:11:39.115
I invited Najimi too,

00:11:39.198 --> 00:11:42.451
but they were already quadruple-booked.

00:11:43.160 --> 00:11:46.163
-<i>Of all people! My mentor!</i>
-SCARED OF EACH OTHER

00:11:46.247 --> 00:11:50.167
You ate lunch with Komi before,
so I figured it would be okay.

00:11:51.127 --> 00:11:52.628
<i>Ah! That's right.</i>

00:11:52.711 --> 00:11:55.506
<i>My mentor came because</i>
<i>she was worried about me!</i>

00:11:55.589 --> 00:11:57.758
We're probably in the way here.

00:11:57.842 --> 00:11:59.135
-Shall we go?
-<i>Okay!</i>

00:11:59.218 --> 00:12:01.387
<i>I've got the perfect date plan.</i>

00:12:01.470 --> 00:12:03.722
-<i>I'll show my mentor!</i>
-Katai? We're going!

00:12:09.019 --> 00:12:11.397
<i>W-What kind of group is that?</i>

00:12:12.231 --> 00:12:13.649
We've arrived.

00:12:19.822 --> 00:12:20.990
<i>Alright!</i>

00:12:21.073 --> 00:12:24.285
<i>I'll elegantly escort Tadano!</i>

00:12:28.456 --> 00:12:29.999
Come with me.

00:12:34.253 --> 00:12:35.880
Come with me.

00:12:39.300 --> 00:12:41.218
<i>Oh no!</i>

00:12:41.302 --> 00:12:44.930
<i>I've never gone ice skating before!</i>

00:12:45.014 --> 00:12:47.266
<i>His perfect date plan broke down.</i>

00:12:50.311 --> 00:12:51.729
K-Katai.

00:12:51.812 --> 00:12:54.440
You've never gone ice skating?

00:12:54.523 --> 00:12:56.442
I'm sor- uh, my bad.

00:12:57.067 --> 00:12:59.487
Komi, do you have experience skating?

00:13:04.742 --> 00:13:06.118
Is that right!

00:13:07.495 --> 00:13:10.206
Well, let's start by
practicing at the wall.

00:13:10.289 --> 00:13:12.333
KNOWS HOW TO SKATE

00:13:12.416 --> 00:13:14.084
H-He's so cool!

00:13:16.128 --> 00:13:19.757
First, put your hand on the wall
and practice walking.

00:13:22.343 --> 00:13:23.719
Ah, a little lower.

00:13:23.802 --> 00:13:26.847
Keep your center of gravity
over your ankles and knees.

00:13:27.515 --> 00:13:30.434
If you walk like that,
you'll keep moving forward.

00:13:30.518 --> 00:13:32.436
And you'll start skating.

00:13:34.939 --> 00:13:35.981
Komi!

00:13:41.820 --> 00:13:45.241
It's alright. I'll teach you
how to stop now.

00:13:46.742 --> 00:13:49.954
Move one foot
in front a little, like this.

00:13:50.454 --> 00:13:51.539
Very good!

00:13:51.622 --> 00:13:54.250
Don't put it too far ahead.

00:13:54.750 --> 00:13:57.836
If you do, you'll spin around…

00:14:02.591 --> 00:14:04.426
Katai! How are you doing?!

00:14:07.304 --> 00:14:09.682
<i>Oh, I see. Those two are…</i>

00:14:11.976 --> 00:14:13.435
<i>Now I understand.</i>

00:14:14.645 --> 00:14:19.733
<i>If he teaches me and we hold hands,</i>
<i>we'll grow closer as friends, Mentor!</i>

00:14:20.734 --> 00:14:22.027
<i>A-Alright!</i>

00:14:22.111 --> 00:14:26.031
<i>I'll hold hands with Tadano and skate too!</i>

00:14:27.616 --> 00:14:29.618
Katai's working hard.

00:14:41.589 --> 00:14:43.007
Oof.

00:14:44.800 --> 00:14:46.510
Are you alright, Katai?

00:14:51.932 --> 00:14:52.975
Yeah.

00:15:25.382 --> 00:15:28.510
Yeah! I skated, Tadano!

00:15:49.031 --> 00:15:52.451
MISSION 63
"IT'S JUST A COLD."

00:15:52.534 --> 00:15:54.912
Are you really alright?

00:15:55.496 --> 00:15:57.373
I'm worried.

00:15:57.456 --> 00:16:00.876
I'm okay. I just have a little fever.

00:16:00.960 --> 00:16:03.462
You'll be back tonight, right? Have fun.

00:16:03.545 --> 00:16:05.881
Okay.

00:16:05.965 --> 00:16:09.093
I'll buy you a souvenir
at the hot spring. Don't die!

00:16:09.176 --> 00:16:10.636
I won't die.

00:16:10.719 --> 00:16:12.429
See you later!

00:16:28.320 --> 00:16:30.239
<i>It's worse than I thought.</i>

00:16:38.247 --> 00:16:39.373
Ugh.

00:16:58.809 --> 00:17:02.521
<i>Oh no. I think I might die.</i>

00:17:02.604 --> 00:17:03.689
ABOUT TO CRY

00:17:03.772 --> 00:17:06.692
-<i>Don't die, don't die, don't die.</i>
-AUDITORY HALLUCINATION

00:17:06.775 --> 00:17:09.361
<i>I-I need some water.</i>

00:17:13.323 --> 00:17:14.825
<i>Dead!</i>

00:17:15.367 --> 00:17:16.577
<i>Death!</i>

00:17:16.660 --> 00:17:17.953
<i>No, no, no!</i>

00:17:18.037 --> 00:17:21.206
<i>If I can get to the fridge,</i>
<i>there'll be something to drink.</i>

00:17:25.627 --> 00:17:27.963
<i>I can't stand! I'm gonna die!</i>

00:17:29.089 --> 00:17:31.258
<i>I need someone to rescue me!</i>

00:17:35.054 --> 00:17:37.931
<i>Najimi! This is a time for Najimi!</i>

00:17:38.015 --> 00:17:41.060
-OSANA, OTORI, ONEMINE, KATAI, KOMI
-<i>Thanks Najimi!</i>

00:17:41.143 --> 00:17:42.895
HASN'T ASKED YET

00:17:44.354 --> 00:17:45.856
<i>Pick up!</i>

00:17:46.940 --> 00:17:48.859
<i>Thanks Najimi.</i>

00:17:48.942 --> 00:17:50.819
HASN'T ASKED YET.

00:17:51.820 --> 00:17:53.781
Hello, Najimi?

00:17:53.864 --> 00:17:56.200
I've caught a little cold.

00:17:56.283 --> 00:18:00.329
I'm sorry, but can you bring me
some Pokaru and something to eat?

00:18:07.294 --> 00:18:09.296
Komi?

00:18:10.047 --> 00:18:11.131
Komi!

00:18:11.215 --> 00:18:15.719
I misdialed! Don't worry about it!

00:18:16.345 --> 00:18:20.224
I'm really just fine!
I'm going to call Najimi now.

00:18:21.725 --> 00:18:25.646
<i>I touched the wrong spot on the screen.</i>

00:18:25.729 --> 00:18:27.147
<i>Get it together!</i>

00:18:27.648 --> 00:18:29.775
-DOESN'T REALIZE HE'S STANDING
-Hello, Najimi?

00:18:39.368 --> 00:18:41.286
<i>I have to go unlock the door.</i>

00:18:45.791 --> 00:18:48.293
<i>I feel like I'm going to collapse.</i>

00:18:55.092 --> 00:18:57.052
Thanks, Naji…

00:19:03.142 --> 00:19:04.518
Komi?

00:19:04.601 --> 00:19:08.313
Uh, um, I don't want you to catch my…

00:19:17.739 --> 00:19:20.659
<i>K-Komi's here.</i>

00:19:28.125 --> 00:19:30.085
CAN YOU DRINK?

00:19:30.169 --> 00:19:31.253
Uh… Yes.

00:19:36.717 --> 00:19:39.970
<i>It smells like ginger. It's good.</i>

00:19:40.053 --> 00:19:41.889
I'LL BE USING THE KITCHEN.

00:19:46.101 --> 00:19:48.979
DELICIOUS EGGS

00:20:05.495 --> 00:20:07.873
DO YOU HAVE AN APPETITE?

00:20:08.957 --> 00:20:10.083
Yes.

00:20:19.301 --> 00:20:20.677
Ah.

00:20:20.761 --> 00:20:23.889
Um, hang on.

00:20:25.182 --> 00:20:28.852
No, uh. I can eat it myself.

00:20:31.271 --> 00:20:34.399
KOMI IS EMBARRASSED BY WHAT SHE WAS DOING.

00:20:34.900 --> 00:20:36.360
Thank you very much.

00:20:38.111 --> 00:20:41.198
Thanks again. That was really good.

00:20:41.698 --> 00:20:45.118
-I'LL GO TIDY UP
-Ah, yes. Sorry, thanks.

00:20:52.084 --> 00:20:54.878
-<i>I have to live.</i>
-TADANO GOT THE STRENGTH TO LIVE

00:21:25.367 --> 00:21:28.537
Hey! Tadano, are you alive?

00:21:28.620 --> 00:21:31.081
Huh? Komi! You're here!

00:21:32.249 --> 00:21:34.459
Huh? You're not here?

00:21:35.043 --> 00:21:37.462
Komi? You're head's going to fall off.

00:21:39.047 --> 00:21:41.216
BONUS SCENE

00:21:41.300 --> 00:21:45.220
Hey, we're home! Are you alive?

00:21:46.221 --> 00:21:48.473
Oh good, he seems alright.

00:21:56.481 --> 00:21:57.941
<i>I smell a girl.</i>

00:21:58.025 --> 00:22:00.319
<i>Tadano's sister sensed something.</i>

00:22:04.740 --> 00:22:06.450
<i>What's happening?</i>

00:22:08.535 --> 00:22:10.287
<i>I'm just too handsome.</i>

00:22:13.206 --> 00:22:15.000
<i>Hmph.</i> <i>If you insist.</i>

00:22:15.083 --> 00:22:17.502
<i>I'll give you a little sample.</i>

00:22:20.422 --> 00:22:21.631
<i>Hey there.</i>

00:22:25.218 --> 00:22:26.678
<i>This story's</i>

00:22:27.596 --> 00:22:29.389
<i>handsome hero.</i>

00:23:55.934 --> 00:24:01.982
Subtitle translation by: Claire Tanaka
